WEBVTT

00:10:27.955 --> 00:10:31.427
And I also hope that you

00:10:31.427 --> 00:10:32.749
share the idea that

00:10:32.749 --> 00:10:34.755
if engineers and designers

00:10:34.755 --> 00:10:36.267
can use all these different

00:10:36.267 --> 00:10:38.228
climatic parameters,

00:10:38.228 --> 00:10:41.235
it will be possible to create

00:10:41.235 --> 00:10:44.324
really good and comfortable

00:10:44.324 --> 00:10:45.604
outdoor conditions,

00:10:45.604 --> 00:10:48.733
to change our thermal perception

00:10:48.733 --> 00:10:50.611
that we feel comfortable

00:10:50.611 --> 00:10:52.699
in an outdoor environment,

00:10:52.699 --> 00:10:55.091
and we can do that

00:10:55.091 --> 00:10:56.955
with the best passive design,

00:10:56.955 --> 00:11:00.131
but also using the energy source